= Reproducibility self-assessment

To promote open science and research integrity, the following describes reproducibility of this MSc thesis:

  1. *Data Availability:* Data is available publically from Google Earth Engine. Under the academic license all data can be retrieved by registering a Google Cloud project. The download scripts in the repository contain all necessary code to retrieve data.
  2. *Code Availability:* All code is freely available on GitHub: https://github.com/carlocordes/Transformer_Wildfire_Workspace
  3. *Documentation:* Documentation of the code is included in the repositories #emph[README.md]
  4. *Reproducibility Rating:* I rate the reproducibility of this thesis as medium-high